{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>Behold, a place is with Me, and you shall stand upon the rock.</b> I found in Shochar Tov: Rav Chanina said: Why is the name of the Holy One, blessed be He, called 'Makom'? As it is said: ״אל המקום״ — because He is the place of the world. And I still do not know: is His place subordinate [to the world]? But when He says: ״הנה מקום אתי״ — you infer that 'place' is subordinate to Him."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:04:36.663567500Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}